@startuml 27_timing_heartbeat
title Agent heartbeat freshness (each time unit = 10 seconds)
robust "Host connection state" as H
@0
H is PENDING
@1
H is CONNECTED : first report at 10 s
@2
H is CONNECTED : new report at 20 s
@3
H is CONNECTED : last report at 30 s
@7
H is STALE : no report for 40 s
@8
H is CONNECTED : valid report resumes at 80 s
note bottom of H
  Example stale threshold is 35 seconds after last accepted
  coordinator receipt (30 + 35 = 65 s).
  Host state never claims the physical machine is powered off.
end note
@enduml
